# Python agent layout

- **schemas/** — Pydantic request/response and tool I/O models.
- **tools/** — allowlisted tool entrypoints + registry only.
- **services/** — data loading and analytics (no FastAPI routes).
- **agent/** — router, answers, prompts, orchestrator (no DB SQL).
- **data/** — seed / fallback datasets; keep aligned with PortfolioAPI when shared.
- **api/** — HTTP adapters only; call tools/services, do not embed business rules.

Do not put tool result templates or route patterns in API routers — keep them in `agent/answers.py` and `agent/router.py`.
